  "review": "<h2 id=\"intro\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【秋旅特集】【2026】日光・鬼怒川の秋を愉しむ！紅葉絶景と渓谷美の温泉宿10選</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\">日本一早い紅葉が訪れる奥日光から、渓谷美が映える鬼怒川温泉へと紅葉が染まりゆく栃木県の日光・鬼怒川エリア。世界遺産・日光東照宮参拝やドライブの拠点に最高の、名湯と絶景を併せ持つ10選を紹介します。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-2\">🍁 日光・鬼怒川・奥日光の秋旅で失敗しない3つのチェックポイント</h3>\n  <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-xs text-stone-800 font-medium\">\n    <li>山々や渓谷、日本庭園が美しく色づく絶景ロケーションの客室＆大露天風呂を厳選</li>\n    <li>地場ブランド和牛や旬の海鮮・秋野菜を味わう職人手作りの秋会席＆バイキング</li>\n    <li>主要観光名所や駅・高速ICからのアクセスの良さと、マイカー旅行に安心の無料駐車場完備</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"selection\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">厳選10選！おすすめ絶景温泉宿・名門旅館</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1選</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">鬼怒川温泉　あさや</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.92</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/8643/8643.jpg\" alt=\"鬼怒川温泉　あさや\" class=\"w-full h-44 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡 創業130年！吹き抜けの空中庭園露天風呂「昇龍の湯」と100種豪華バイキング</p>\n      <p><strong>【おすすめポイント】</strong> 秋の絶景美を至近で愉しむ優雅な湯浴みと、地場特産の極上秋会席。</p>\n      <p><strong>【設備・アクセス】</strong> 天然温泉大浴場、敷地内無料駐車場完備、主要観光スポットまでアクセス良好。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-2 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F8643%2F8643.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow-md hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n      ✈️ 鬼怒川温泉　あさや の最新空室状況・限定お得プランを見る（楽天トラベル公式）\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2選</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">日光温泉　日光千姫物語</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.92</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/41382/41382.jpg\" alt=\"日光温泉　日光千姫物語\" class=\"w-full h-44 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡 東照宮まで徒歩圏内！女性に大人気の風雅な和風旅館と日光湯波会席</p>\n      <p><strong>【おすすめポイント】</strong> 秋の絶景美を至近で愉しむ優雅な湯浴みと、地場特産の極上秋会席。</p>\n      <p><strong>【設備・アクセス】</strong> 天然温泉大浴場、敷地内無料駐車場完備、主要観光スポットまでアクセス良好。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-2 text-center